xcodebuild -project GlobalBridge.xcodeproj -scheme GlobalBridge -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17,OS=latest' build

This command will compile the entire iOS project and show any compilation errors in the Cursor output panel, allowing you to fix issues
immediately after editing Swift files. The scheme "GlobalBridge" is confirmed from the project's .xcscheme file.